  "post_content": "<p>The Autan Plus Band ofreci&oacute; la noche de esta s&aacute;bado un vibrante concierto en el local de la asociaci&oacute;n &#39;Rellamp&#39; de la calle San Fernando de Onda, en el que actuaron como teloneros Mil excusas.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2012/12/IMG_8752.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>La actuaci&oacute;n se enmarca dentro de las <a href=\"http://www.eltriangulo.es/contenidos/?p=32853\" target=\"_blank\">II jornadas de puertas abiertas y conciertos</a>&nbsp;de la asociaci&oacute;n &#39;Rellamp&#39; que agrupa a conjuntos de rock de Onda, que ensayan en la misma nave que ya gestionaba la Fundaci&oacute;n Pere S&aacute;nchez Segarra antes de ser disuelta por el actual Ayuntamiento.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertrellampautan/img_8751.jpg\" alt=\"img_8751\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertrellampautan/img_8752.jpg\" alt=\"img_8752\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertrellampautan/img_8753.jpg\" alt=\"img_8753\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertrellampautan/img_8754.jpg\" alt=\"img_8754\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertrellampautan/img_8755.jpg\" alt=\"img_8755\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertrellampautan/img_8756.jpg\" alt=\"img_8756\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertrellampautan/img_8757.jpg\" alt=\"img_8757\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertrellampautan/img_8758.jpg\" alt=\"img_8758\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertrellampautan/img_8759.jpg\" alt=\"img_8759\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertrellampautan/img_8760.jpg\" alt=\"img_8760\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertrellampautan/img_8761.jpg\" alt=\"img_8761\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertrellampautan/img_8762.jpg\" alt=\"img_8762\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertrellampautan/img_8763.jpg\" alt=\"img_8763\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertrellampautan/img_8764.jpg\" alt=\"img_8764\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /></div>"
